  'player.enquire': "Enquire", 'enquiry.human': "The club is run by another manager – message them in the chat or make an offer.", 'enquiry.price': "{club} on {player}: We will consider offers around {fee}", 'enquiry.listed': "{club} on {player}: He is for sale, and the price is {fee}", 'enquiry.nfs': "{club} on {player}: He is not for sale – only an exceptional offer of at least {fee} would make us listen.", 'enquiry.answer': "{club} replied on {date}: they will consider offers around {fee}", 'enquiry.answerNfs': "{club} replied on {date}: not for sale – only for at least {fee}", 'bid.theirPrice': "Club's price", 'bid.nfsShort': "otherwise not for sale", 'bid.matchPrice': "Offer their price", 'bid.hintUnknown': "You don't know the club's price. Make an enquiry first, or try your luck.", 'bid.hintOver': "You are offering well above the club's price ({fee}) – money you don't need to spend.", 'bid.hintAtAsk': "The offer matches the club's price – it will probably be accepted.", 'bid.hintClose': "A little below the club's price ({fee}) – they will probably make a counter-offer.", 'bid.hintLow': "Far below the club's price ({fee}) – they may reject it outright.", 'bid.hintNfs': "The club won't sell for less than {fee}.", 'bid.hintNfsMet': "Enough for the club to sell.",
  'reject.title': "Reject the offer for {player}", 'reject.ask': "Do you want to explain to {player} why you said no? A reason that fits can make him happy to stay – one he doesn't believe makes it worse.", 'reject.reason.none': "Reject without explanation", 'reject.reason.key': "\"You're a key player – we're building the team around you\"", 'reject.reason.low': "\"The offer was far too low – you're worth more\"", 'reject.reason.contract': "\"We'd rather give you a new and better contract\"", 'reject.contractHint': "He will then expect a contract offer soon.", 'reject.submit': "Reject the offer", 'reject.r.key.2': "{player}: Thanks, boss. It means a lot that you're building the team around me. {club} is forgotten – I'll give everything for us.", 'reject.r.key.1': "{player}: Okay, I hear what you're saying. But then I want to feel it on the pitch.", 'reject.r.key.0': "{player}: Key player? I barely play. That doesn't add up – I'm disappointed.", 'reject.r.key.1Calm': "{player}: Nice to hear. I wasn't planning on moving to {club} anyway.", 'reject.r.key.0Calm': "{player}: Key player? I haven't noticed much of that. But {club} doesn't appeal to me much either.", 'reject.r.low.2': "{player}: That's right – I'm worth more than that. Good that the club stands firm.", 'reject.r.low.1': "{player}: Maybe… but it was a decent offer. I hope you listen if they come back with more.", 'reject.r.low.0': "{player}: Too low? That was a huge offer! I feel the club is standing in my way.", 'reject.r.low.1Calm': "{player}: Understood. I'm happy here anyway.", 'reject.r.low.0Calm': "{player}: It was a good offer, but fine – I wasn't keen on moving.", 'reject.r.contract.2': "{player}: Sounds good! If the club shows it believes in me, I'm happy to stay. I look forward to the offer.",
